  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive). No transitive pair. Pattern: X⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{会|あ}う (meet X).\n\nASPECT: ている indicates ongoing or habitual action. {会|あ}っている = 'is meeting' or 'have been meeting (regularly).'\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{友達|ともだち}→友達：01478_tomodachi⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{会|あ}う (meet a friend)\n- ⟦{久|ひさ}しぶり→久しぶり：01711_hisashiburi⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{会|あ}う (meet after a long time)\n- ⟦{初|はじ}めて→初めて：02932_hajimete⟧{会|あ}う (meet for the first time)\n- {会|あ}いたい (want to meet/see someone)\n\nIMPORTANT: Takes に, not を. Don't confuse with ⟦{合|あ}う→合う：10466_au⟧ (to match/fit) which uses different kanji.",
